        Battle Siege Damage (50% Threshold): Any attack where the attacking force has at least 50% of the target's Defence Power (Offence >= 50% Defence) now inflicts structural damage on the port's fortifications, reducing the fortification level by 1 (down to Level 0).

    Successful Raze Destruction: A successful Raze attack devastates the port's defenses, reducing fortifications to Level 1 (or down to Level 0 if they were already at Level 1).

    Game Guide Integration: Added the Fortification Siege Damage rules under Garrison Combat Mathematics in the Captain's Manual (GameGuide.tsx).
