    Manned Cannon Calculation: In all battles (attacking fleets and defending port garrisons), the number of operational cannons is capped at Math.floor(Crew / 2).
Combat Power Impact: Unmanned cannons provide 0 Offence or Defence Power in battle resolutions, live intelligence forecasts, scout reports, and leaderboard army value calculations.
UI & Intelligence Briefings: Updated Military.tsx and Dashboard.tsx to clearly indicate manned cannon counts (e.g. 1/2 Manned), alerting players if they have crew shortages when setting up campaigns or inspecting port garrisons.
